{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000006340","bookName":"El amor se rompió en la prueba","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000006340/42000006340.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":981594,"followCount":15517,"introduction":"Esteban y su esposa, Lila, han pasado cinco años ahorrando cada centavo para la cirugía que salvaría a su hijo, Carlos. Pero, en nombre de “poner a prueba su amor y confianza”, Lila —quien en secreto es una heredera adinerada— gasta todos sus ahorros en lujos. Su decisión retrasa la operación y, finalmente, provoca la muerte de su hijo. Al final, no solo deja al descubierto su ignorancia, sino que también demuestra cuán crueles y absurdas son esas supuestas pruebas de amor.","chapterCount":70,"labels":["Winning Him Back","Family Bonds"],"tags":["Winning Him Back","Family Bonds"],"typeTwoIds":[303],"typeTwoNames":["Urbano"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":303,"name":"Urbano","replaceName":"urbano"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Urbano","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"El-amor-se-rompió-en-la-prueba","bookNameLower":"el-amor-se-rompió-en-la-prueba","shelfTime":"2026-02-25 00:00:01","firstShelfTime":"2026-02-25 00:00:01","performerList":[{"performerId":"21001","performerName":"Yuxiu Chen","performerFormatName":"Yuxiu-Chen","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/1x0/21001/21001.jpg?time=1788864768338","videoCount":11}],"performerIdList":[21001]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700416043","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/34/0x4/04x3/043x6/04360000024/700416043_1/700416043.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=jsiyjht~MI168E6yIJFgDtZQdFAxj~uE-bEg4VoB~dD-GUJ7rjTy2If4zsLbXIt7Tj56VnHjxnbFJB~xzU69aYSvUHpG8wCRrRh8Br-2Q8kMpEQIHzb3JcoBY4hoqRkIZyj8xvTG9wx3uxTC2r6Yd7IUpJofGtyNS05pZVbWiUfox7~llq8UmOfyM5WOlmwYt4LbtVHrlflhG4t58-RLf6il-UcyTAd5J9xsdBL29WjYhrXmvXr5gy1dIv41mTAnMEobc7dFLKLSr9H2QmAannPROP3jBQYj42bF6KWGLciJ3T2j8LhkekH6Njv~g2MJXF-C0q-PPCZb2WattuzsvQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2T